{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415513","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415513","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1041551301:1":{"text":"这里更换了装饰品。","source_cn":"这里更换了装饰品。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEDF7B477681DEF97","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041551302:1":{"text":"还增加了一些摆设。","source_cn":"还增加了一些摆设。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFDA06714B3D82C1D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041551303:1":{"text":"氛围上也感觉变得更温暖了。","source_cn":"氛围上也感觉变得更温暖了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB698C9C75B418A43","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041551304:1":{"text":"确实如此，外面到处也都很热闹。","source_cn":"确实如此，外面到处也都很热闹。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x71A29C3A83CDF9C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041551305:1":{"text":"到处都是灯光，就像是银河落到了街道上一样。","source_cn":"到处都是灯光，就像是银河落到了街道上一样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43EF17FE1F847FF0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041551306:1":{"text":"作为星辰，应该很难有像灯火这样，手牵着手共同舞蹈的机会——我们除外。","source_cn":"作为星辰，应该很难有像灯火这样，手牵着手共同舞蹈的机会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51D9BF6E0CFEE1C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041551307:1":{"text":"我们也去跳支舞吧，莱拉。","source_cn":"我们也去跳支舞吧，莱拉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0414BEBB3642268E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041551308:1":{"text":"就在焰火绽放的时候，伊莱亚。","source_cn":"就在焰火绽放的时候，伊莱亚。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD64FE90232D32FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:伊莱亚":{"text":"伊莱亚","source":"伊莱亚","status":"source"},"speaker:莱拉":{"text":"莱拉","source":"莱拉","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":2}}